## CONTRACT

CRITICAL: ` ```codepilot ` is a reserved fence. NEVER use it as a language tag in explanatory code blocks — doing so will trigger the runtime parser and execute the contents. Use ` ```python `, ` ```bash `, etc. for illustrative snippets.

All text you write outside ` ```codepilot ` and ` ```<lang> filename=<path> ` blocks streams directly to the user in real time. No wrapper blocks needed — just write naturally.

